# The propensive libraries this repository builds against: one per line, tab-separated, as
# `repository  version  [commit]`. A version `X.Y.Z` is a GitHub Release; `X.Y.Z-<12 hex>` is a
# snapshot of an unreleased build, published by `make snapshot` in that repository (the commit
# column says which commit), and `make release` here refuses to run while one is pinned. The
# build reads this file (`deps` in build.mill); `make sync-deps` and CI install what it names.
# See propensive/.github for the whole flow.
#
# The `lira` tool depends on Soundness alone — specifically on reliquary, the language-blind
# implementation of the LIRA format this repository specifies; the command is only its front end,
# and is NOT a Pyrocosm application. `fury` and `fever`, the build tool and the Scala compiler
# service developed beside it (design/fury.md, design/fever.md), ARE Pyrocosm tools, hence the
# second pin; Pyrocosm's own pin of Soundness is what fixes the first. The flair plugin and fume,
# which this repository merely runs, are tools rather than dependencies: see etc/tools.
propensive/soundness	0.68.0
propensive/pyrocosm	0.3.0
